# Evaluator-owned receipts are committed; harness state, workspaces, raw harness logs and per-trial tokens are not. #142's rules, narrowed: all harness state stays out (no Hermes SOUL.md), and there are no gbrain hook receipts to keep.
trials/*/*/*/state/
trials/*/*/*/workspace/
trials/*/*/*/logs/*
!trials/*/*/*/logs/adapter.log
trials/*/*/*/trial.json
*.sqlite-shm
*.sqlite-wal
trials/*/*/*/compose.serve.yaml
# The gbrain sidecar's per-trial token and logs, and every preflight's token and sidecar logs, stay out of the repository.
trials/*/*/*/gbrain/
*preflight-*/
**/ingest-tokens.json
**/tokens.json
# The shard logs the preregistration names as receipts are kept despite the root *.log rule.
!/*.log
